<title>JAPAN: BOXING-VASQUEZ RETAINS WBA FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-VASQUEZ RETAINS WBA FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Champion Wilfredo Vasquez of Puerto Rico retained his World Boxing Association (WBA) featherweight crown when the referee stopped his fight against Japanese challenger Yuji Watanabe in the fifth round of their scheduled 12-round bout on Sunday.</p>
</text>
